@startuml
title Agentic Delivery bounded contexts
left to right direction

rectangle "Architecture Authority" as architecture
rectangle "Agentic Delivery Control Plane" as control
rectangle "Agentic Primitives" as primitives
rectangle "Developer Distribution" as distribution
rectangle "Public .github adapter" as public
rectangle "Private .github-private adapter" as private

architecture --> control : pinned architecture release
architecture --> primitives : ADR and concept references
primitives --> control : selected capabilities
primitives --> private : promoted agent projection
primitives --> distribution : primitive release
distribution --> control : thin consumer integration
public ..> control : optional pinned starter

@enduml
